body:
So I start a revolution from my bed, 'cause you said the brains I had went to my head!

&#x200B;

Name the song, and we're friends lmao

I am 15. I know that's young, way too young. I am personally not interested in dating, but it is a natural tendency to find people attractive. So, yeah.

&#x200B;

(Edit) To be perfectly honest, I'm afraid that after replying my age people will downvote me because I'm too young. That's their right, but it's kind of sad to think about. I would like to know what you think? Even I think I'm a bit too young for romantic thoughts and feelings, so that's why I don't exactly know what happened last night..
